OL,3,GNEWSA'Shoplifters will take anything':
OL,4,ALife in a theft hotspot
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs I enter a shop on Grimsby's High
OL,7,FStreet, I feel watched. Partly by the
OL,8,Fkeen eye of the shopkeeper but also
OL,9,Fthanks to the presence of numerous CCTV
OL,10,Fcameras perched in each corner.
OL,12,FThe owner tells me he sees shoplifting
OL,13,Fevery day.
OL,15,FI'm on Victoria Street West, which is a
OL,16,Fhotspot for shop thefts. According to
OL,17,Fdata gathered by the BBC, it is where
OL,18,Fnearly 10% of recorded incidents in
OL,19,FNorth East Lincolnshire take place.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
