OL,3,GNEWSA'Shoplifters will take anything':
OL,4,ALife in a theft hotspot
OL,5,
OL,6,FFigures also show there are 15.7
OL,7,Fincidents of shoplifting per 1,000
OL,8,Fpeople in the local authority area. The
OL,9,Fnational rate is 8.1.
